  "corrections": [
    "During the existing staffing pass, return surplus idle builders and diggers to carriers, newest IDs first. Drop their actual equipment as owned physical goods before changing profession. Busy, walking, assigned or laden workers keep their work.",
    "With no ground space, keep the worker and tool until normal delivery frees room. Surplus crew cannot begin fresh work above the reduced cap while tool return is blocked.",
    "Ground drops merge only compatible goods owned by the dropping player. A foreign pile keeps its ownership and quantity; the returned tool is placed separately.",
    "Show the actual saved rules version in the guide. Crew-recovery guidance appears only for a supporting profile. Older saves retain their previous rules."
  ],
